{
  "headline": "Cefuroxime is not on FDA's shortage list as of 2026-10-21; the label for Hikma's product names a plant in Portugal with a history of VAI and OAI inspections",
  "headline_cites": ["D3", "E12", "E3", "E5"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's drug shortage list does not include cefuroxime as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The product label for Hikma Pharmaceuticals USA Inc. (NDC 00143997722) identifies the manufacturing plant as HIKMA FARMACEUTICA (PORTUGAL), S.A. (FEI 3002807173) in Portugal.",
      "cites": ["E12"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection records for that plant show a VAI classification in 2011, an OAI classification in 2014, and subsequent VAI classifications in 2015, 2016, 2020, and 2023.",
      "cites": ["E3", "E5", "E6", "E7", "E8", "E9", "E10"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A Warning Letter was issued to the plant on 2014-10-21.",
      "cites": ["E11"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 158 vials of the 1.5 g presentation with 10.5 days on hand; Corvale General holds 367 vials with 25.6 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule‑based best option is to buy from B. Braun Medical Inc., which is not on FDA's shortage list today and whose label names no plant we could place.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    }
  ]
}
